; RFC 5234 ABNF mirror (descriptive, not test-walked — the real byte-level walker is
; ../📡️component.protocol.semio, walked by dsl::walk_protocol) for the SemioTableMutation binary
; op frame.
op-frame    = format tag payload
format      = OCTET               ; OP_BINARY_FORMAT, currently 1
tag         = OCTET                ; variant ordinal, 0-7 (see OP_KEYWORDS)
payload     = *OCTET               ; the variant's own argument tail, UTF-8 text-op-args bytes
